This crate is a Rust port of the DG Scripts interpreter in The Builder Academy
(tbaMUD): `tbamud/src/dg_scripts.c`, `dg_triggers.c`, `dg_mobcmd.c`,
`dg_objcmd.c`, `dg_variables.c`, `dg_comm.c` and the interpreter entry points
they call.

tbaMUD is derived from CircleMUD (created by Jeremy Elson) and DikuMUD (by
Sebastian Hammer, Michael Seifert, Hans Henrik Staerfeldt, Tom Madsen and Katja
Nyboe). This crate is a derivative work of that C source and is subject to the
CircleMUD and DikuMUD licences, reproduced in full in
[`LICENSE-TBAMUD`](LICENSE-TBAMUD) in this crate (and at the repository root).
The crate's `license-file` points at the bundled copy so it travels with the
package. The required attribution is in [`NOTICE`](../../NOTICE); the original
Rust expression is MIT under the repository [`LICENSE`](../../LICENSE).

The CircleMUD and DikuMUD licences forbid making money from the game, its code
or its data in any way. Do not remove any copyright, licensing or authorship
